  "reasoning": "The defendant negligently dug up a communication cable, causing interruption of telecom services for many users. This constitutes the crime of damaging public telecommunication facilities (过失损坏公用电信设施). No theft or other offenses are described, so the appropriate charge is the specific offense of damaging public telecommunication facilities, which in the label set corresponds to \"破坏广播电视设施、公用电信设施\".",
